3nw3NaA&oe=6B0C5486"}, "display_name": "Brassline: Gunfight Noir", "keywords": ["shooter", "noir", "arcade", "action", "coop"], "long_description": "Brassline is an on-rails gunfight in the spirit of the arcade light-gun classics, across Port Calder by night and by day. By night: the docks, a bank job, the last train, a night market, a glass tower, a causeway chase and a helicopter. By day: a beach that ends in a boat chase, a film lot where the cover is plywood, and a runway where you stop a plane.\n\n- **Fair by design.** An enemy about to fire shows a ring that closes and turns red, and nobody fires from point-blank range or from behind you. If you get hit, you missed the ring.\n- **Use your body.** Bullets fly slowly enough to see. Lean, duck, or shoot them out of the air. Cover stops rounds where you see it, and nowhere else.\n- **Real sound, no music.** Your footsteps and the city keep the rhythm. Every gun has its own voice, and every place has its own echo.\n- **Skill shots.** Hit the gun to disarm a gunman and he surrenders. Free hostages, pistol-whip knife rushers, set off fuel barrels and clear a room in slow motion.\n- **Build your armoury.** Six guns to collect, from the issued pistol to a lever-action .44. Four difficulties, seven modifiers, a Daily Case, S-to-D ranks and gun finishes to earn.\n- **Squad.** Up to four headsets on one Wi-Fi ride side by side. No accounts, nothing to type. Computer partners fill any empty seats.\n- **Play your way.** Standing or seated, with controllers or bare hands (curl your finger to fire). Comfort options: a vignette, quick-cut turns, calmer flashes, slow motion off.", "short_description": "Ten cases across Port Calder, from its worst night to the morning after. Every threat is announced by a closing ring, every bullet is slow enough to see and lean out of the way of, and every shot, casing and ricochet sounds real. By night, the docks, a bank job and a helicopter chase; by day, a beach that ends in a boat chase, a film studio's backlot and a runway after a cargo plane. Play solo with computer partners, or as a squad of up to four on the same Wi-Fi."}]}, "developer_name": "SaneBits", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sanebits.com/products/brassline/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "SaneBits", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sanebits.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1424151146560587"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1734100918716816"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1734100918716816"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1793909400, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1734100918716816"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1428686119440423", "version": "1.0.0"}, "id": "2142075569750744", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1424151143227254", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1428686119440423"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": 